# error: 45:14: cannot assign through a read view (`?T`); `w` is a read view of a field of `o ?? E.b`: to write through it, bind `o ?? E.b` to a name first, then match it with `match !`
# error: 50:14: cannot assign through a read view (`?T`); `w` is a read view of a field of `peek(h)`: to write through it, match a write view instead: a place with `match !`, or a call that returns one
